{"productId": "2a54afbf-07fe-445b-be7e-60acb59504ef", "modelName": "X-Bolt Stalker Long Range", "modelDescription": "The X-Bolt Stalker Long Range isn't flashy . . . but it is durable and \u2014 most importantly \u2014 capable of the overall exceptional accuracy that has caused the X-bolt to be compared with custom guns costing thousands more. \n\nThe X-Bolt Composite Stalker is an excellent rifle choice for hunting in conditions where you may not wish to take the traditional walnut stocked rifle. The X-Bolt Composite Stalker's stock is made from tough, composite material that can take a beating. The stock is textured for a secure grip from forearm to pistol grip. It also has a comfortable palm swell. This long range model also includes an adjustable comb system that makes it easy to place your eye in correct scope alignment with larger, long-range optics.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "915d2ca4-8b08-4329-bbe8-9da81b6d0561", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt Stalker LR, Bolt Action, 6.8 Western, 26\" Barrel, Black Finish, Right Hand, Composite Stock, 4 Round", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/6ccc9cb4-8ce9-4ab4-a34d-be7b017a777b", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d9d88f48-fbbc-4f0c-8bdd-8629a08a14b8", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/617e2a71-3ff1-443d-befc-51125d7dc5c5"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "035528299", "upc": "023614744818", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "f889927a-8dc3-4be8-ba23-0a3351ad0d54", "valueName": "6.8 Western"}, {"attributeNameId": "4ab35fad-b30f-4bac-b424-1cab633c8b2e", "attributeName": "Threaded", "attributeValueId": "ca40d661-4714-43df-9e7e-235b3241995a", "valueName": "Yes"}, {"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "6496f1a7-dcbf-4cf